// GPU settings preset: high
//
// A texture edge of 2048 voxels and 32 GB of texture memory, the largest
// memory of the presets. `high` is the default preset of Cornerstone3D when
// `auto` does not exist. Select it only on a device that holds that much
// texture memory. A device of the middle class can crash under it.
//
// A preset applies only with final downsampling on, and a preset in this
// customization turns final downsampling on, also in config/default.js.
// Nothing probes the device: a preset is a set of values, so a real device may
// hold more or less than the preset states.
//
// Load it with `?customization=gpu/high`.
{
  "bootstrap": {
    "cornerstone.gpuSettingsPreset": "high"
  }
}
